# local-server-health-check
owner: looker · cadence: every 30 minutes while servers are expected up · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a recurring check that verifies your local mlx_lm endpoints are still bound on the right ports and haven't been killed mid-prompt?**

## Prompt
Check 127.0.0.1:11613 and the current ornith port; log state; alert on missing or mismatched bindings.

## Evidence
> The server on 11613 is MTPLX. Ornith is on 11622.
